// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Volkov_Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P998722091" "My rangers have reported the existance of an illegal Crey Industries base in the area. I've received orders to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>take that base out</A>. This has to be done quickly, though. They can abandon the base in as little as 45 minutes."
// AcceptString :
"P223445533" "Take out Crey base within 45 minutes"
// SendOffString :
"P2343099262" "Glad to have the help, {HeroName}. Here's the plan: I've marked the base for you, your job is to get into it, defeat all of the Crey personnel on site, and locate the data. Like I said, you'll have maybe 45 minutes from this point before Crey gets wise and clears out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1809256510" "Defeat all Crey in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4268140978" "You need to get into that Crey base and defeat all of the hostiles on site. There's a time limit on this, so you better keep it moving fast."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P642784083" "This base is one of many that Crey industries has illegally set up in the Shadow Shard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3527945086" "You took out the base before Crey could evacuate it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1877858249" "You were unable to defeat all of the Crey personnel in time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1067612822" "Crey should be hurting from that one, but that won't be the last base they'll try to set up. They've still got a lot of funds and a lot of interest in the Shadow Shard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1413504694" "Any operation can hit snags, so don't get too bent about it. Yeah, you didn't get the job done in time, but Crey still had to evacuate the base. There'll be other bases. Crey's not done yet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Volkov_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ShardData 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
