"P1494356942" "Illegally obtained data"
// DetailString :
"P3931594742" "These computer files contain information Crey illegally obtained about the physics and life-forms of the Shadow Shard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3502630828" "I have confirmed reports about a base being illegally operated by Crey Industries in the area. I've received orders to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>take that base out</A> and keep Crey from keeping any illegally obtained data. This has to be done quickly, though. The base can be evacuated in as little as 60 minutes."
// AcceptString :
"P2577346841" "Take out Crey base and recover illegally obtained data within 60 minutes"
// SendOffString :
"P3016509158" "I'm always glad to have volunteers. Here's the plan of action: I've marked the base for you, your job is to get into it, defeat all of the Crey personnel on site, and locate the data. Like I said, you'll have maybe an hour at most."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P606834218" "You need to get into that Crey base, defeat all of the hostiles on site, and locate the data. You better hurry. There's not a lot of time left."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3713337646" "The Crey defenders of this base don't look like they'll give up without a fight."

