// IntroString :
"P2129025603" "My scouts have found a major Crey base in this area, a research center being run by {CHAR_NAME}, one of their top researchers and a wanted criminal. Major Hammond's asked me to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>capture {CHAR_NAME} and recover Crey's illegal research data</A> any way I see fit before they can evacuate the base. I thought that this might be just your type of work. The only catch is that Crey will evacuate the place in less than 75 minutes once they know they're under attack."
// AcceptString :
"P379832705" "Capture {CHAR_NAME} and recover illegal research data"
// SendOffString :
"P244207383" "You'll have two main targets to wrap this up successfully. First, you'll need to recover all of Crey's research data. Second, you'll need to capture {CHAR_NAME} and all of his assistants to stop his research for good. You'll have about 75 minutes."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2254657179" "Capture {CHAR_NAME}, his staff"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3149671066" "You have two main targets to wrap this up successfully. First, you'll need to recover all of Crey's research data. Second, you'll need to capture {CHAR_NAME} and all of his assistants to stop his research for good. You'll have about 75 minutes."

